\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">I'm planning to ...</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">How about we visit the cathedral?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">As far as I'm concerned</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">I'm going to ...</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to trample ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to cause damage or pain by walking or stepping on something or someone ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)  ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The bulls trampled the man.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le05ob11aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words to review.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to explore  ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to look at something in a careful way ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Let's explore Paris together!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le05ob11aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to celebrate  ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to do something special or enjoyable for an important event ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm going to Rio to celebrate at Carnival.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le05ob11aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to suggest ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to talk about something someone may want to try ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I suggest you take time off.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le05ob11aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "dangerous ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "can lead to injury or death ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The Running of the Bulls in Pamplona can be dangerous.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le05ob11aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "masterpiece ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "something done with great skill ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)  ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The Guggenheim Museum is a masterpiece. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le05ob11aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "magnificent  ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "very impressive ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It is a magnificent museum.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le05ob11aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "engenn4le05ob11re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Choose a landmark in a different city.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Go online. Find information about the landmark.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Complete the table below.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Present the information to a partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Where is it located?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nb